v14 BUG: install.sh 老 lookup 只查 release/mac-arm64/Hermes.app,但
apps/desktop productName='文枢' → electron-builder 输出文枢.app → 找不到
→ exit code 1 (log: 2026-07-28T01:51:24.429685Z ✗ no app was found)

修法: scripts/install.sh 新增 _find_built_desktop() 函数,候选列表包含
文枢.app (新名) + Hermes.app (兼容老名) + WenShu.app (备用),install_desktop()
改用新函数 (line 3115).

中文翻译 (装机 user 拍 '能用中文的地方用中文, 脚本和代码正常用英文'):
- scripts/install.sh: emit_manifest 11 步 stage title + install_desktop
  log/run_stage error 中文 (37 处)
- src-tauri/src/lib.rs: setup callback / hermes installed / managed uv /
  show window / webview 6 处 log 中文
- src-tauri/src/paths.rs: installer already / copied installer 2 处 log 中文
- src-tauri/src/powershell.rs: stdout read / stderr read / cancellation
  3 处 log 中文
- 前端 src/routes/*.tsx: success/progress/failure/welcome 文案中文
  (前置 CC 已 commit)

build 验: cargo tauri build exit 0 (1m 12s, incremental), DMG 重 bundle
(sha256=9fdc79a1a7b41416d729d7dc439b23c83dd4337bf696a9565f706b7364b14f4f,
5,502,001 bytes), cp 到 ~/Downloads/WenShu-Setup.dmg (sha256 一致).

落档: wenshu-pour/architecture/v14-{diagnosis,fix,rebuild-trace,i18n-strategy}-
2026-08-28.md (4 文件, 每个 ≥ 5KB).

